        "task_prompt": "Answer briefly using only these facts. Periodic service is recommended every 10,000 km or 1 year, whichever is earlier (EV6 and EV9 every 20,000 km or 1 year). Standard warranty is 3 years or 1 lakh km; extended warranty can be bought at the workshop. Exact service cost depends on model and parts, and the service advisor will share an estimate before work starts. Then offer to book a service appointment.",
        "say_on_enter": null,
        "fields": [],
